  m_overrideMarkdownText: "## AssistantAI Wrapper\n\n<a href=\"./Assets/SpatialLingo/Scripts/AI/AssistantAI.cs\">AssistantAI.cs</a>
    encapsulates the prompts, chats, and data passing, JSON parsing necessary to
    communicate with the model and receive C# objects.\n\nThe class is initialized
    by passing an instance of the MetaModelRestApi:\n\n```csharp\nvar assistantAI
    = new AssistantAI(modelApi);\n```\n\nBy abstracting the details away, the Assistant
    AI interface allows for more targeted usage. As an example, word clouds are generated
    from a single classification & cropped camera image (from an object recognition
    pass). The result is a rich description of the scene with nouns, verbs, and adjectives.\n\n```csharp\n//
    Definition (<a href=\"./Assets/SpatialLingo/Scripts/AI/AssistantAI.cs\">AssistantAI.cs</a>):\npublic
    async Task<WordCloudResult> GenerateWordCloudData(SupportedLanguage userLanguage,
    SupportedLanguage targetLanguage, string classification, string imageString,
    string context = null)\n\n// Call:\nvar wordCloudResult = await m_assistantAI.GenerateWordCloudData(userLanguage,
    targetLanguage, classification, imageString);\n\n// wordCloudResult contains
    parts of speech for presentation to the user during gameplay\n```\n\nTo prepare
    an image for a request, `GetNetworkSafeImageString` scales the texture down to
    a pixel budget of about 400\xD7300 (never up), optionally blurs any faces in
    it, and encodes it as a JPEG base64 data URL (`data:image/jpeg;base64,...`) ready
    to pass as `imageString`. Smaller images keep requests fast and token usage low:\n\n```csharp\n//
    Definition (<a href=\"./Assets/SpatialLingo/Scripts/AI/AssistantAI.cs\">AssistantAI.cs</a>):\npublic
    static async Awaitable<string> GetNetworkSafeImageString(Texture2D imageSource,
    FaceDetection faceBlur)\n\n// Call (pass null instead of a FaceDetection to skip
    face blurring):\nvar imageString = await AssistantAI.GetNetworkSafeImageString(croppedImage,
    faceDetection);\n```\n\n"
  m_overrideMarkdownRoot: .\Packages\com.meta.utilities.metamodelapi/
